Bundled fonts

theme.css embeds the following fonts as base64 WOFF2 data. They are NOT
covered by the MIT license above; each remains under the SIL Open Font
License, Version 1.1. The full license text is in fonts/OFL.txt and the
copyright notices are in fonts/NOTICE.md.

- Vazirmatn       — Copyright 2015-2023 The Vazirmatn Project Authors
- Markazi Text    — Copyright 2016 The Markazi Text Project Authors
- JetBrains Mono  — Copyright 2020 The JetBrains Mono Project Authors
